    "narrative": "For today\u2019s slate, **Corbin Carroll** stands as our premier offensive anchor, commanding an elite 82.27 score against Ethan Pecko. With Pecko\u2019s xERA sitting at a vulnerable 6.19 and **Corbin Carroll** benefiting from a favorable platoon split, he is perfectly positioned to hunt for multi-hit potential and steals. We are also leaning heavily into **Vinnie Pasquantino** (76.21) and **Trevor Story** (73.82), both of whom capitalize on high-efficiency matchups. **Vinnie Pasquantino** draws a soft assignment against Max Scherzer, whose 5.03 xERA suggests a regression to the mean that favors our slugger\u2019s plate discipline, while **Trevor Story** benefits from a distinct park factor boost that elevates his ceiling despite the matchup against Bassitt.\n\nWhile the volatility of \"Lineup Pending\" status necessitates caution, **Jose Caballero** (72.55) is a vital inclusion; his dynamic platoon edge against Ray makes him an essential sparkplug for our stolen base targets. Conversely, **Max Muncy** (46.25) barely survives the cut, as his matchup against George Kirby\u2014a significantly more dangerous arm\u2014drags his efficiency toward our bench floor. **Austin Riley** was our most difficult exclusion, posting a 44.53 score; he was ultimately sat because the combination of a tough outing against Wheeler and a low-leverage spot in the batting order provided a lower projected return than the high-upside deployments of **Vinnie Pasquantino** and **Isaac Paredes**.\n\nWe are proceeding with caution regarding **James Wood** (51.15), whose start is anchored by a massive order advantage despite a brutal matchup against the elite arm of Tyler Glasnow. While his xwOBA of 0.418 provides a safety net, owners should watch for early-game adjustments against Glasnow\u2019s strikeout profile. Finally, we continue to monitor the status of **Tyler Soderstrom**, who remains sidelined on the IL, further thinning our depth and forcing the current configuration of our utility slots to carry the load for the remainder of the week.",
